<section id="main" class="wrap page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE LEARNING FIELD</p><h1>学习中心<span class="serif-accent"> / 从这里出发</span></h1><p>按路径建立共同基础，再根据项目选择方向。教程可以边用边查，学完后记得亲手完成一次练习。</p><label class="search-label" for="lesson-search">查找教程</label><div class="search-box"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="lesson-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索标题或关键词，例如 Git、路径、调试" autocomplete="off"><span id="search-count" aria-live="polite"><%= site.data.learning.lessons.length %> 篇教程</span></div></section>
<div class="wrap learning-layout"><aside class="learning-nav"><p class="eyebrow">学习路径</p><% site.data.learning.groups.forEach(function(group, i) { %><a href="#<%= group.id %>"><span>0<%= i+1 %></span><%= group.title %></a><% }) %><a class="download-link" href="<%= theme.repository %>/tree/main/source/learn">查看 Markdown 源文 ↗</a></aside><div class="learning-groups"><% site.data.learning.groups.forEach(function(group, index) { %><section class="lesson-group" id="<%= group.id %>"><div class="group-heading"><span>0<%= index+1 %></span><div><h2><%= group.title %></h2><p><%= group.description %></p></div></div><div class="lesson-list"><% site.data.learning.lessons.filter(function(lesson) {return lesson.group === group.id}).forEach(function(lesson) { %><a class="lesson-row" data-search="<%= lesson.title + ' ' + lesson.description + ' ' + lesson.keywords %>" href="<%- url_for('/learn/' + lesson.slug + '/') %>"><div><h3><%= lesson.title %></h3><p><%= lesson.description %></p></div><span class="lesson-arrow">↗</span></a><% }) %></div></section><% }) %><p id="search-empty" hidden>没有找到匹配教程，可以尝试其他关键词。</p></div></div>
